pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$background"
elements:
  # ===== NAV BAR =====
  - elementId: nav-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 0, 1280, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$primary"

  - elementId: nav-active
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [960, 0, 320, 40]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: nav-t1
    elementType: text
    bounds: [0, 0, 320, 40]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>维度一: Source</p>

  - elementId: nav-t2
    elementType: text
    bounds: [320, 0, 320, 40]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>维度二: Propagation</p>

  - elementId: nav-t3
    elementType: text
    bounds: [640, 0, 320, 40]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>维度三: Sink</p>

  - elementId: nav-t4
    elementType: text
    bounds: [960, 0, 320, 40]
    content:
      style: "$nav"
      align: [center, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>维度四: Verification</p>

  - elementId: nav-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [0, 40, 1280, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  # ===== TITLE =====
  - elementId: page-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 54, 1160, 40]
    content:
      style: "$title"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>防御策略：从漏洞发现到设备防护</p>

  # ===== CARD 1: 接口资产清单 =====
  - elementId: card1-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [60, 120, 270, 520]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [6000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$panel"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$rule"

  - elementId: card1-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 140, 40, 4]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: card1-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 156, 230, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$accent"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>维度 1</strong></p>

  - elementId: card1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 190, 230, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.3
      align: [left, top]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>接口与参数资产清单</strong></p>

  - elementId: card1-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [80, 258, 230, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$rule"

  - elementId: card1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [80, 274, 230, 340]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>• 统一接口注册表，所有Web handler、CGI、Lua handler、REST API必须登记</p>
        <p>• URI-Key规格化管理，定义类型、长度、范围、编码</p>
        <p>• 输入源点显式标注，区分外部用户与系统内部Source</p>
        <p>• 发布前比对前后端参数，强制审查后端独有参数</p>

  # ===== CARD 2: 跨组件安全边界 =====
  - elementId: card2-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [350, 120, 270, 520]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [6000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$panel"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$rule"

  - elementId: card2-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [370, 140, 40, 4]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: card2-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [370, 156, 230, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$accent"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>维度 2</strong></p>

  - elementId: card2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [370, 190, 230, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.3
      align: [left, top]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>跨组件数据流安全边界</strong></p>

  - elementId: card2-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [370, 258, 230, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$rule"

  - elementId: card2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [370, 274, 230, 340]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>• IPC数据键分级，标注可被Web请求间接控制的key</p>
        <p>• Setter/Getter双向约束，写入前净化、读取后验证</p>
        <p>• 跨语言调用边界防护，禁止Lua拼接命令直接传C</p>
        <p>• 组件最小权限，Web进程低权限，高危操作受控API</p>

  # ===== CARD 3: 隐藏接口治理 =====
  - elementId: card3-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [640, 120, 270, 520]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [6000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$panel"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$rule"

  - elementId: card3-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [660, 140, 40, 4]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: card3-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [660, 156, 230, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$accent"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>维度 3</strong></p>

  - elementId: card3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [660, 190, 230, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.3
      align: [left, top]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>隐藏接口治理与认证</strong></p>

  - elementId: card3-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [660, 258, 230, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$rule"

  - elementId: card3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [660, 274, 230, 340]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>• 消除未注册路由Token，构建阶段扫描阻断异常</p>
        <p>• 调试接口发布门禁，test/debug等不得进入正式版</p>
        <p>• 路由分发前统一认证授权，敏感操作验证角色</p>
        <p>• 一致化错误响应，不泄露内部路径和版本信息</p>

  # ===== CARD 4: 约束一致性主动发现 =====
  - elementId: card4-bg
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [930, 120, 270, 520]
    shapeName: roundRect
    adjustments: [6000]
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$panel"
    border:
      style: solid
      width: 1
      color: "$rule"

  - elementId: card4-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [950, 140, 40, 4]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$accent"

  - elementId: card4-num
    elementType: text
    bounds: [950, 156, 230, 30]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$accent"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>维度 4</strong></p>

  - elementId: card4-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [950, 190, 230, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 20
      color: "$primary"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.3
      align: [left, top]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p><strong>约束一致性主动发现</strong></p>

  - elementId: card4-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [950, 258, 230, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill:
      type: solid
      color: "$rule"

  - elementId: card4-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [950, 274, 230, 340]
    content:
      fontSize: 16
      color: "$text"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans, MiSans"
      lineHeight: 1.5
      align: [left, top]
      text: |
        <p>• 三类约束统一建模：前端显式、后端显式、Sink期望</p>
        <p>• 识别约束不一致：前端限长后端不限→高风险</p>
        <p>• 从URI-Key清单自动生成合法请求与验证用例</p>
        <p>• 修复后回归：已确认漏洞转化为回归测试，防补丁遗漏</p>

  # ===== FOOTER =====
  - elementId: footer-left
    elementType: text
    bounds: [60, 690, 400, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [left, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>网络设备Web服务安全研究</p>

  - elementId: footer-right
    elementType: text
    bounds: [1100, 690, 120, 20]
    content:
      style: "$caption"
      align: [right, middle]
      wrap: false
      text: |
        <p>36 / 37</p>
